 "text": "Torivac-Products\n\n×\n\nProducts\n\nVoltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\n+\n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDesktop equipment\n\nDouble Variator\n\nRegulating accessories\n\nSingle Phase Inverters\n\nThree-phase drives\n\nTransformers\n\n+\n\nConventional transformer\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\n+\n\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\n\nBAVS Series: Electronics\n\nRheostats and coiled potentiometers\n\n+\n\nCeramic rheostats\n\nPotentiometers\n\nEncapsulated coils\n\n+\n\nRound\n\nSquares\n\nChokes | Inductances | Toroidal Reactances\n\n+\n\nNuclei\n\n+\n\nPortaled\n\n+\n\nled 10mm\n\nled 3mm\n\nled 5mm\n\nled 8mm\n\nSockets\n\n+\n\nHB4 socket\n\nHSR4 safety socket\n\nSafety socket HBS4\n\nsafety socket HR4\n\nResistors : Load banks\n\n+\n\nBoxed\n\nBraking resistors\n\nCemented\n\nGrounding resistors\n\nHelical\n\nLoad banks\n\nStarting resistors\n\nElectronic equipment\n\n+\n\nConverters\n\nDC power supplies\n\nIndustrial control\n\nRenewable energies\n\nControl buttons\n\n+\n\nArrow Discs\n\nArrow hoops\n\nBM series control buttons (Matte)\n\nBM Series Covers\n\nBO series control buttons (bright)\n\nBO Series control buttons with line\n\nBO series covers\n\nCasing covers\n\nEstators\n\nGraded covers\n\nGraduated discs\n\nThe caps corresponding to the BM series are matte, with a flat profile, which facilitates any engraving on their surface. They are ordered separately from the buttons and are supplied plain or with an engraved line. \n\nSee technical data sheet\n\nCONTACT WITH US\n\nDo you need technical advice or a quotation?\n Write us and we will solve it for you\n\nIn Torivac you will find a wide range of specialized products for voltage regulation, designed to offer maximum performance in industrial applications and high demanding electrical systems. We have multiple sizes and formats, as well as custom manufacturing options that guarantee a solution adapted to every need. Our team of experts is ready to advise you on the best choice for your project. \n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\n\n*\nI agree to the privacy policy\nSend\n\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and Google’s Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\n\nExplore similar products\n\nGraded covers\n\nNut covers\n\nArrow discs\n\nBO series covers\n\nView full catalog",
